    "question": "Can handwriting data collected for screening be used for other purposes?",
    "answer": "Draft guidance, to be confirmed against verified UAE sources: use the handwriting data only for the stated purpose (screening for learning difficulties with counsellor review). Any other use, such as product analytics beyond what parents agreed to, advertising or profiling, needs a separate legal basis and fresh consent, and inferred learning-difficulty signals must never be reused for commercial purposes.",
